### ④ 타이포그래피
- **폰트 페어링**:
  - 영문: **Google Sans** (Workspace 헤더) / **Roboto** / system-ui
  - 한글: Pretendard / Noto Sans KR
  - 코드: Roboto Mono / SF Mono
- **위계**:
  - Display: 32px / 600 / 1.2 (Google Sans)
  - H1: 24px / 500 / 1.25
  - H2: 18px / 500 / 1.3
  - H3: 16px / 500 / 1.35
  - Body Large: 14px / 400 / 1.5
  - Body: 14px / 400 / 1.5
  - Body Small: 13px / 500 / 1.4
  - Caption: 12px / 500 / 1.3

